---
title: "Drug Dosage Calculations"
code: "NUR-135"
category: "nursing"
credits: "2"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Focuses on apothecary, metric, household conversion in medication dosage calculation for adult and pediatric clients. Provides a practical approach to learning to calculate and prepare medications and solutions. Includes calculating intravenous flow rates. Lecture 2 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
